---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy | PhotoEditingPrompt" desc="How PhotoEditingPrompt handles data: no accounts, no photo uploads, and what is stored in your browser.">
  <div class="narrow">
    <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> › Privacy Policy</nav>
    <h1 class="page-title" style="font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,44px);margin:28px 0 20px">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Last updated: 15 November 2026.</p>
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>{SITE.name} has no accounts and no forms. We do not ask for your name, email address or photos. Photos are uploaded by you directly to ChatGPT or Gemini and never pass through this site.</p>
      <h2>What is stored in your browser</h2>
      <p>If you switch to the dark theme, your choice is saved in your own browser so the site remembers it. Nothing else is stored.</p>
      <h2>Hosting and logs</h2>
      <p>Our hosting provider may keep standard server logs, such as IP address and browser type, for security and reliability.</p>
      <h2>Analytics and advertising</h2>
      <p>This site does not currently use analytics or advertising. If that changes, this page will be updated first to name the services used and the cookies they set.</p>
      <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
      <p>Prompt pages link to ChatGPT and Gemini. Those services have their own privacy policies.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this policy: <a class="link" href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
